1
00:00:00,470 --> 00:00:01,750
Mister!

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,340
[Episode 10]

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:07,790
Mister!

4
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:12,900
Mister!

5
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,460
Hey, Minchae.

6
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:35,540
What? Yun collapsed?

7
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:38,140
Why? What's wrong?

8
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,180
Okay.

9
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:45,260
Okay. I'll be right there.

10
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,690
Yeah. I'm leaving now.

11
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:56,800
Mister.

12
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:14,890
Minchae! Can you call her cell again?

13
00:02:14,890 --> 00:02:17,600
Said she'll come, so she'll be here soon.

14
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:20,980
It's been 30 minutes already. Where did she say she is?

15
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:23,020
Where is she coming from?

16
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:24,840
I didn't ask her.

17
00:02:27,420 --> 00:02:29,990
Why is that brat doing this to me?

18
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,600
Yun!

19
00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:40,140
Yeah?

20
00:02:40,140 --> 00:02:42,760
Why are you doing this?

21
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,600
Huh?

22
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:48,040
I'm saying this because I care.
Stop confusing her.

23
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:50,840
She gets confused even if you tell her directly.

24
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,140
I'm not going to make her feel confused anymore.

25
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:57,840
I won't. Don't worry.

26
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,840
Do I look sick, Minchae?

27
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:31,180
I'm dating Eunchae.

28
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:35,900
Yun collapsed?

29
00:03:36,770 --> 00:03:39,670
Why? What's wrong?

30
00:03:42,050 --> 00:03:43,310
Okay.

31
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:02,860
Yeah, Minchae. I'm in front of the house.

32
00:04:04,370 --> 00:04:07,840
Yeah. I'm coming inside soon. Is Yun okay?

33
00:04:16,790 --> 00:04:17,900
Eunchae.

34
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,660
Hey, Minchae.

35
00:04:19,660 --> 00:04:21,900
Eunchae. What did you do to Yun?

36
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:25,180
I think Yun's in shock because of you.

37
00:04:25,180 --> 00:04:28,110
I heard his heart is damaged from the car accident.

38
00:04:28,110 --> 00:04:30,970
Why don't you be more careful?

39
00:04:30,970 --> 00:04:33,340
I'll tell Mom some excuse.

40
00:04:33,340 --> 00:04:36,140
That's the best for all of us.

41
00:05:13,330 --> 00:05:14,700
Uncle?

42
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:19,680
Uncle, why are you sleeping here?

43
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:24,000
It's cold here. Wake up.

44
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,950
Mom! Let's go get some sweet cakes.

45
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:28,850
Galchi! Uncle is sleeping on the ground.

46
00:05:31,930 --> 00:05:33,640
It's blood...

47
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:38,010
Uncle! Uncle! Uncle!

48
00:05:38,010 --> 00:05:40,220
What do I do?

49
00:05:40,220 --> 00:05:44,480
Grandpa! Grandpa!

50
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:47,790
Uncle! Uncle!

51
00:05:49,900 --> 00:05:51,210
Wake up!

52
00:05:51,210 --> 00:05:53,960
Wake up!

53
00:06:05,610 --> 00:06:08,090
Here. Help me.

54
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,660
Uncle...

55
00:06:20,470 --> 00:06:22,920
Uncle...

56
00:07:14,735 --> 00:07:16,880
[Recent Calls:
Song Eunchae, Song Eunchae, Song Eunchae]

57
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:18,820
[Song Eunchae]

58
00:07:25,860 --> 00:07:27,540
Don't answer it...

59
00:07:27,540 --> 00:07:28,540
Yun.

60
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:31,050
Don't move. Stay with me.

61
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:35,290
You were awake?

62
00:07:36,230 --> 00:07:40,780
Yeah. I was awake from the start.

63
00:07:41,770 --> 00:07:46,000
I made Minchae lie to make you come here.

64
00:07:51,710 --> 00:07:54,090
I think I'm crazy, Eunchae.

65
00:07:55,340 --> 00:07:59,990
I can't stand being without you.

66
00:08:01,250 --> 00:08:04,420
Maybe I really do need to grow up like you said.

67
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:06,850
I think I've become a baby.

68
00:08:06,850 --> 00:08:13,000
Like a baby that cries when his mother is away.

69
00:08:16,770 --> 00:08:21,330
I won't ask you to stay forever.
Just until I fall asleep.

70
00:08:22,530 --> 00:08:26,670
Stay until I fall asleep. Please?

71
00:09:22,710 --> 00:09:25,060
I think I'm crazy, Eunchae.

72
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:29,880
I can't stand being alone without you.

73
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:37,140
So pretty! Such a pretty car!

74
00:09:37,140 --> 00:09:39,030
Is it really Eunchae's car?

75
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:41,690
I know. It's our car now.

76
00:09:41,690 --> 00:09:44,280
I'm so happy!

77
00:09:45,810 --> 00:09:48,500
I can't stop smiling!

78
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:54,310
When the Bosamos hear about this
they'll die from jealousy!

79
00:09:54,310 --> 00:09:58,390
All those that looked down on me
would have nothing to say!

80
00:09:58,390 --> 00:10:00,080
What's "Bosamo"?

81
00:10:01,110 --> 00:10:03,650
Botox lovers community.

82
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:08,010
I can't hold it in much longer.

83
00:10:08,010 --> 00:10:11,830
Choi Yun is going to be my son-in-law!

84
00:10:11,830 --> 00:10:15,750
At least twelve people will go crazy from jealousy!

85
00:10:15,750 --> 00:10:20,740
I know! Myeongsuk, Mija, Yeongsuk...

86
00:10:20,740 --> 00:10:22,760
When I tell them Yun is going to be my brother-in-law,

87
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:25,800
They'll want to move out of the country.

88
00:10:26,810 --> 00:10:28,480
I didn't know you were so good at counting...

89
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:33,010
Counting all those chickens before they hatch...

90
00:10:33,010 --> 00:10:35,640
What are you talking about? Aren't you going to school?

91
00:10:35,640 --> 00:10:36,960
Go to school!

92
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:40,920
Okay! I'll go! You're so materialistic!

93
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:45,790
I wonder if this really is the best for all of us.
Is Eunchae happy?

94
00:10:45,790 --> 00:10:48,940
What are you babbling about?

95
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:57,960
This is a secret.

96
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:07,100
But doesn't it feel like Yun hurt
his head in the accident rather than his heart?

97
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:10,980
I know. I was thinking the exact same thing!

98
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:12,440
Jinx.

99
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:19,570
Right? I mean, how could a guy like Yun like Eunchae
unless he had brain damage?

100
00:11:19,570 --> 00:11:20,620
I know!

101
00:11:20,620 --> 00:11:25,300
She's my daughter but realistically and objectively,
it's too good to be true.

102
00:11:25,300 --> 00:11:27,070
I know!

103
00:11:29,130 --> 00:11:31,980
So he doesn't even look at Kang Minju anymore?

104
00:11:31,980 --> 00:11:33,490
Yeah.

105
00:11:33,490 --> 00:11:37,360
But... What if he comes to his senses?

106
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:39,500
What? Comes to his senses?

107
00:11:39,500 --> 00:11:46,680
If his brain recovers...
He'll take the car back, I'm sure.

108
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:50,020
If he breaks up with Eunchae...
What will happen to Eunchae?

109
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:51,640
We would be so doomed.

110
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:53,410
I know...

111
00:11:53,410 --> 00:11:57,810
Let's have the wedding before he comes to his senses!
Let's just do it!

112
00:11:57,810 --> 00:11:58,950
How about that?

113
00:11:58,950 --> 00:12:00,490
Mom!

114
00:12:03,610 --> 00:12:06,415
Hey, don't you think we are being

115
00:12:06,415 --> 00:12:09,220
too awful and selfish?

116
00:12:09,220 --> 00:12:12,410
I know.

117
00:12:12,410 --> 00:12:15,950
What? What did you say you want to do?

118
00:12:15,950 --> 00:12:17,280
Get married.

119
00:12:19,380 --> 00:12:23,250
I want to marry Eunchae. Water!

120
00:12:23,250 --> 00:12:27,120
What? Are you feeling okay?

121
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:35,640
Eunchae's changed. I'm worried.

122
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:38,260
She's different.

123
00:12:38,260 --> 00:12:41,150
If I don't do something, she might run away.

124
00:12:42,550 --> 00:12:43,840
What's wrong?

125
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:47,970
Mom, I think I need Eunchae.
No, I must have her, Mom.

126
00:12:47,970 --> 00:12:54,070
I don't understand. Do you have a fever?

127
00:12:54,070 --> 00:12:58,410
I'm alive because of Eunchae.
When I had the accident...

128
00:12:58,410 --> 00:13:04,010
I can't explain it, but Eunchae saved me.

129
00:13:05,210 --> 00:13:07,110
I need to have Eunchae.

130
00:13:07,110 --> 00:13:11,150
No matter what, I need to have Eunchae.

131
00:13:12,670 --> 00:13:14,220
Help me.

132
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:17,990
Help me, Mom. Okay?

133
00:13:22,790 --> 00:13:24,880
You're really not sick anymore?

134
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:26,430
Yeah, I'm okay now.

135
00:13:26,430 --> 00:13:29,980
I was so shocked, I thought I
was going to have a heart attack.

136
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:33,680
Don't get sick again.

137
00:13:33,680 --> 00:13:34,950
Okay.

138
00:13:44,580 --> 00:13:46,910
Are you jealous of the boys with their dads?

139
00:13:46,910 --> 00:13:50,710
No. I have you, my uncle.

140
00:13:50,710 --> 00:13:56,620
That's right! You've got a cool,
handsome uncle right here!

141
00:13:57,620 --> 00:14:01,680
We'll come here every day from now on...

142
00:14:01,680 --> 00:14:04,480
And every day we'll...

143
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:11,350
Raise your arm...

144
00:14:11,350 --> 00:14:12,600
Uncle...

145
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,120
Huh?

146
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:16,190
Don't go to Australia.

147
00:14:16,190 --> 00:14:17,580
What?

148
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:23,330
Don't go to Australia.
Stay and live happily ever after with us.

149
00:14:23,330 --> 00:14:27,420
I'll be good and study really hard.

150
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:31,520
And I'll tell Mom not upset you.

151
00:14:32,510 --> 00:14:34,470
You won't go, right?

152
00:14:34,470 --> 00:14:37,960
Don't go, okay? Don't leave, Uncle.

153
00:14:41,430 --> 00:14:42,990
Okay, you little brat!

154
00:14:42,990 --> 00:14:45,430
Lee Galchi! Raise your arm!

155
00:15:01,450 --> 00:15:03,100
You're so dirty!

156
00:15:30,340 --> 00:15:32,200
[Missed call: Mister Pervert]

157
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:48,200
I'm going out.

158
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,660
- Where are you going?
- What?

159
00:15:50,660 --> 00:15:54,800
Yun isn't working today. Where are you going?

160
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:57,540
Oh...

161
00:15:58,230 --> 00:16:00,490
Meeting Muhyeok?

162
00:16:03,730 --> 00:16:06,270
Want to have a drink with me instead?

163
00:16:06,270 --> 00:16:09,420
- Right now?
- Yeah, now.

164
00:16:10,270 --> 00:16:12,220
It's still daytime, Dad.

165
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:15,000
Is there a rule against day drinking?

166
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:18,810
Give me a minute. Let me get dressed.

167
00:16:57,560 --> 00:16:58,800
Bottoms up!

168
00:16:58,800 --> 00:16:59,990
Okay.

169
00:17:12,820 --> 00:17:14,150
Dad.

170
00:17:15,270 --> 00:17:17,110
Yeah?

171
00:17:17,110 --> 00:17:20,310
I'm a bit drunk now...

172
00:17:20,310 --> 00:17:24,520
We're only on our fourth bottle.

173
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:26,850
Since when were you so soft, my daughter?

174
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:33,340
What's on your mind, Dad?

175
00:17:43,510 --> 00:17:45,470
About Muhyeok...

176
00:17:47,370 --> 00:17:51,000
Forget him before it gets serious.

177
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,110
Dad...

178
00:17:52,110 --> 00:17:56,610
Even if it's already serious...
Don't do it. Forget him.

179
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:04,100
Why? Because of Yun?

180
00:18:16,430 --> 00:18:20,820
I don't want Yun anymore, Dad.

181
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:27,000
Coming and going whenever he calls...

182
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:31,860
I'm not a dog.

183
00:18:33,370 --> 00:18:36,520
Let's move. I'll look for a new house.

184
00:18:37,630 --> 00:18:40,110
Also quit being his coordinator.

185
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:45,370
Do you want to go back to school?
How about studying abroad?

186
00:19:00,130 --> 00:19:05,590
Dad. I'm sorry.

187
00:19:05,590 --> 00:19:12,070
But I can't forget Muhyeok.

188
00:19:12,070 --> 00:19:13,210
Eunchae...

189
00:19:13,210 --> 00:19:21,270
I was lonely and sad when I liked Yun...

190
00:19:22,270 --> 00:19:26,750
But not with Muhyeok.

191
00:19:28,510 --> 00:19:33,150
I feel grateful and warm.

192
00:19:34,780 --> 00:19:45,290
I worry so much that Muhyeok might be
sad and lonely because of me.

193
00:19:46,500 --> 00:19:48,050
Eunchae...

194
00:19:50,580 --> 00:19:53,360
I can't forget him now...

195
00:19:57,430 --> 00:20:00,520
I can't forget him, Dad...

196
00:20:30,950 --> 00:20:34,530
Huh? Where'd the bullet go?

197
00:20:36,290 --> 00:20:39,670
Isn't it amazing that I'm still alive... Sir?

198
00:20:39,670 --> 00:20:43,760
Have a seat.
You must have been in a lot of pain lately.

199
00:20:43,760 --> 00:20:48,010
It's my first time seeing my brain like this.
Unbelievable...

200
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:51,580
The bullet is embedded between the blood vessels,

201
00:20:51,580 --> 00:20:54,410
adding more and more pressure
to your brain as time passes.

202
00:20:54,410 --> 00:20:59,150
The blood vessel is getting weaker
and thinner as it stretches.

203
00:21:01,870 --> 00:21:05,170
I didn't come here to hear all that.

204
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:09,600
Prescribe me some medicine.

205
00:21:09,600 --> 00:21:10,950
Cha...

206
00:21:10,950 --> 00:21:12,460
Muhyeok!

207
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:15,430
Mr. Cha Muhyeok.

208
00:21:15,430 --> 00:21:18,380
I can withstand the pain.

209
00:21:18,380 --> 00:21:24,300
But I get nosebleeds, get dizzy
and pass out everywhere.

210
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:30,100
That's all I need you for. It's making life tough.

211
00:21:30,100 --> 00:21:31,680
It must be very tough these days.

212
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:35,105
Until I die, let me live a great life,

213
00:21:35,105 --> 00:21:38,530
not a pathetic one

214
00:21:38,530 --> 00:21:41,510
where I'm vomiting, bleeding,
and passing out everywhere.

215
00:21:41,510 --> 00:21:43,150
Give me something.

216
00:21:46,600 --> 00:21:50,630
Medicine... Give me some medicine!

217
00:21:50,630 --> 00:21:52,680
It must be so tough.

218
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:56,120
It's not tough!

219
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:58,840
I told you. I'm not here for your sympathy!

220
00:21:58,840 --> 00:22:01,600
I'm here because I'm embarrassed to live like this!

221
00:22:56,220 --> 00:23:00,920
I'm just asking for the sake of asking...

222
00:23:02,500 --> 00:23:08,800
But... Are you not capable of saving my life?

223
00:23:14,480 --> 00:23:21,660
It's just, you look a lot smarter
than my fat, Australian doctor.

224
00:23:24,370 --> 00:23:26,240
I guess not.

225
00:23:34,220 --> 00:23:45,020
The increasingly painful headaches, the nosebleeds...

226
00:23:45,020 --> 00:23:52,910
Do those mean I haven't got much time left?

227
00:23:57,980 --> 00:24:00,304
And lastly...

228
00:24:02,886 --> 00:24:05,570
One more question.

229
00:24:09,210 --> 00:24:18,740
Is death really my only option?

230
00:24:34,300 --> 00:24:36,100
Ma'am!

231
00:24:36,100 --> 00:24:39,810
The doctors here are quacks! Don't go in.

232
00:24:42,700 --> 00:24:44,280
Don't go!

233
00:25:00,650 --> 00:25:06,580
What a sight!

234
00:25:06,580 --> 00:25:11,440
The whole family is nuts...

235
00:25:24,670 --> 00:25:26,300
Yes?

236
00:25:26,300 --> 00:25:27,640
Blockhead!

237
00:25:54,520 --> 00:25:56,320
Be careful.

238
00:25:59,560 --> 00:26:09,890
When my dad wakes up,
will you tell him I had to go?

239
00:26:09,890 --> 00:26:11,370
Thank you.

240
00:26:11,370 --> 00:26:14,600
Are you gonna be okay?

241
00:26:14,600 --> 00:26:17,390
I'll be fine. Goodbye.

242
00:26:17,390 --> 00:26:20,280
Oh, no. What should I do?

243
00:27:35,220 --> 00:27:36,450
Eunchae.

244
00:27:36,450 --> 00:27:37,670
Mister.

245
00:27:37,670 --> 00:27:40,000
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

246
00:27:45,720 --> 00:27:47,170
Cold, huh?

247
00:27:48,150 --> 00:27:49,480
Come here.

248
00:27:56,360 --> 00:27:57,600
Are you warm?

249
00:28:53,890 --> 00:28:56,520
Let's be fair.

250
00:28:56,520 --> 00:28:57,620
What?

251
00:28:58,220 --> 00:29:05,120
I'm super drunk, so you have to be drunk, too.

252
00:29:05,120 --> 00:29:07,550
It's only fair.

253
00:29:09,410 --> 00:29:13,390
Fair is my favorite word in the whole world.

254
00:29:13,390 --> 00:29:16,680
Why did you drink so much during the day?

255
00:29:16,680 --> 00:29:19,450
I had my reasons.

256
00:29:19,450 --> 00:29:23,500
You know.
One of those days you can't handle reality sober.

257
00:29:25,510 --> 00:29:31,390
I'm having one of those days, too.

258
00:29:33,180 --> 00:29:39,590
See? We're so perfect for each other, aren't we?

259
00:29:39,590 --> 00:29:41,000
Here!

260
00:29:50,300 --> 00:29:51,680
Chaser.

261
00:29:55,620 --> 00:29:58,660
You get kinder and kinder.

262
00:29:58,660 --> 00:30:03,940
And you listen to me... Such a good boy.

263
00:30:07,340 --> 00:30:08,590
Open this one.

264
00:30:45,790 --> 00:30:48,850
You don't have much of a tolerance, do you?

265
00:30:50,530 --> 00:30:53,680
He's passed out after half a bottle of soju.

266
00:30:56,860 --> 00:31:02,190
I wanted to confess something to you
after getting you drunk.

267
00:31:02,190 --> 00:31:04,400
I had something tell you...

268
00:31:11,270 --> 00:31:13,230
Mom...

269
00:31:15,270 --> 00:31:17,530
Mom...

270
00:31:49,950 --> 00:31:51,840
You're sleeping here?

271
00:31:58,140 --> 00:31:59,930
Don't you have a home?

272
00:32:19,070 --> 00:32:21,150
Mommy!

273
00:32:32,100 --> 00:32:34,480
Mister!

274
00:32:44,470 --> 00:32:46,340
Mommy...

275
00:32:50,930 --> 00:32:55,860
I have a husband! I'm married! With children!

276
00:32:55,860 --> 00:32:59,950
Just sleep! Unless you want to die.

277
00:33:38,140 --> 00:33:42,560
We're even now, aren't we?

278
00:34:11,350 --> 00:34:16,360
Eunchae's changed. I'm worried.

279
00:34:17,220 --> 00:34:18,890
She's different.

280
00:34:19,910 --> 00:34:22,540
If I don't do something, she might run away.

281
00:35:17,890 --> 00:35:19,650
Just a moment, Mr. Choi Yun.

282
00:35:19,650 --> 00:35:20,980
Yes?

283
00:35:20,980 --> 00:35:23,140
Here's the new album.

284
00:35:23,140 --> 00:35:25,430
- Wow, it's already done?
- It's really good.

285
00:35:25,430 --> 00:35:26,530
Thank you.

286
00:35:26,530 --> 00:35:28,150
- See you later.
- Okay.

287
00:35:40,400 --> 00:35:42,040
How have you been?

288
00:35:43,340 --> 00:35:44,760
Bad.

289
00:35:45,940 --> 00:35:46,850
Why?

290
00:35:46,850 --> 00:35:49,340
I'm just reaping what I've sowed,
being punished for hurting you.

291
00:35:49,340 --> 00:35:54,060
There's no need. Is love an obligation?

292
00:35:54,060 --> 00:35:55,780
Don't feel guilty.

293
00:35:55,780 --> 00:36:02,500
We should think this was meant to happen.

294
00:36:04,910 --> 00:36:09,950
You'll still be my friend, right?

295
00:36:09,950 --> 00:36:12,250
You've become pretty cool, Choi Yun.

296
00:36:12,250 --> 00:36:15,350
Sad that you've lost me, huh?

297
00:36:16,920 --> 00:36:18,430
Little bit.

298
00:36:18,430 --> 00:36:25,110
Mrs. Song said, "You have to be
burned to come to your senses."

299
00:36:26,660 --> 00:36:28,830
I've been burnt. And I've come to my senses, finally.

300
00:36:28,830 --> 00:36:31,990
How is it going with Eunchae?

301
00:36:31,990 --> 00:36:37,660
How about you and that guy?

302
00:36:38,540 --> 00:36:40,310
You should get going, huh?

303
00:36:40,310 --> 00:36:43,530
I'll give you a ride. You can't drive yet, right?

304
00:36:51,990 --> 00:36:56,270
Are you sure you should be working right now?

305
00:36:56,270 --> 00:36:58,790
I heard your heart isn't so healthy.

306
00:36:58,790 --> 00:37:04,390
I'm fine. Doctors always try to scare you.

307
00:37:09,040 --> 00:37:10,700
Rockhead.

308
00:37:13,150 --> 00:37:14,570
Eunchae?

309
00:37:18,410 --> 00:37:25,720
I wish I could walk all night
with you on my back like this.

310
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:29,730
Wanna come with me?

311
00:37:31,420 --> 00:37:36,400
If you came with me... I'd be so happy.

312
00:37:38,170 --> 00:37:43,580
I'd be really happy if you'd just come with me.

313
00:37:46,760 --> 00:37:56,070
This would be the best way to die.
With you on my back.

314
00:38:02,480 --> 00:38:04,210
We're here.

315
00:38:16,430 --> 00:38:18,940
Let's do another lap around the neighborhood.

316
00:38:35,850 --> 00:38:37,270
Eunchae...

317
00:38:41,280 --> 00:38:43,080
Give her to me.

318
00:38:44,830 --> 00:38:47,850
Give her to me. I'll take her.

319
00:38:48,970 --> 00:38:51,000
Give Eunchae to me!

320
00:38:56,710 --> 00:38:59,570
Eunchae. Song Eunchae!

321
00:39:01,420 --> 00:39:05,430
Wake up. Wake up, Song Eunchae!

322
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:19,600
Let me down, Mister.

323
00:39:20,930 --> 00:39:22,360
Let me down.

324
00:39:24,920 --> 00:39:26,290
Yun.

325
00:39:27,190 --> 00:39:28,960
Let's go home.

326
00:39:28,960 --> 00:39:30,780
Let me go.

327
00:39:31,770 --> 00:39:34,820
What are you doing? What are you doing, Yun?

328
00:39:34,820 --> 00:39:37,120
- Let go. Let my hand go!
- Let her go!

329
00:39:37,120 --> 00:39:39,710
She said to let go!

330
00:39:50,610 --> 00:39:54,830
Don't disrespect her.

331
00:40:01,130 --> 00:40:03,345
Blockhead...

332
00:40:03,345 --> 00:40:05,560
Sweet dreams.

333
00:40:48,230 --> 00:40:54,410
Are you dating Muhyeok?

334
00:40:55,500 --> 00:40:56,890
No.

335
00:41:00,740 --> 00:41:02,520
It's okay then.

336
00:41:04,380 --> 00:41:07,520
Go. Sweet dreams

337
00:41:10,390 --> 00:41:11,730
I...

338
00:41:14,360 --> 00:41:17,860
I want to take Muhyeok's hand.

339
00:41:19,890 --> 00:41:23,610
You don't need me.

340
00:41:23,610 --> 00:41:31,350
You've always been fine without me.
You'll be fine without me.

341
00:41:31,350 --> 00:41:32,750
But Muhyeok...

342
00:41:32,750 --> 00:41:34,120
Eunchae!

343
00:41:34,630 --> 00:41:36,930
Let me go.

344
00:41:38,810 --> 00:41:40,800
Please, Yun?

345
00:41:44,450 --> 00:41:46,140
I'm sorry.

346
00:41:47,750 --> 00:41:49,350
I'm sorry.

347
00:42:51,880 --> 00:42:54,560
What are you doing?

348
00:42:54,560 --> 00:42:56,640
In the middle of the night?

349
00:42:56,640 --> 00:42:59,870
Why? Is there something wrong?

350
00:43:05,040 --> 00:43:07,530
Yun! Yun?

351
00:43:07,530 --> 00:43:10,150
Yun!

352
00:43:10,150 --> 00:43:12,830
What's wrong?

353
00:43:12,830 --> 00:43:14,620
Yun!

354
00:43:25,450 --> 00:43:26,880
Eunchae!

355
00:43:30,250 --> 00:43:32,490
No. You're wrong. This couldn't be.

356
00:43:32,490 --> 00:43:35,790
Run the tests again. I said test him again.

357
00:43:35,790 --> 00:43:38,950
Test him again. It doesn't make sense.

358
00:43:38,950 --> 00:43:41,680
It just doesn't make sense, doctor.

359
00:43:42,800 --> 00:43:49,520
That's why I asked that he avoid stress.

360
00:43:51,800 --> 00:43:55,130
But... He was fine. He was fine.

361
00:43:55,130 --> 00:44:00,380
Didn't you see him on TV? He was healthy and fine.

362
00:44:00,380 --> 00:44:05,230
Actually, we didn't expect it
to get worse so suddenly, either.

363
00:44:05,230 --> 00:44:08,820
Yun's symptoms aren't external.

364
00:44:08,820 --> 00:44:12,230
So you have to be careful at all times.

365
00:44:12,230 --> 00:44:14,620
I can't accept it. I won't. Run the tests again.

366
00:44:14,620 --> 00:44:18,910
I don't believe for a second that
a boy that healthy is terminally ill.

367
00:44:18,910 --> 00:44:21,510
Does that make sense, doctor?

368
00:44:21,510 --> 00:44:26,600
I'm going to get a second opinion.
I'll take him to a different hospital right now!

369
00:44:27,410 --> 00:44:29,900
Calm down. Please.

370
00:44:31,860 --> 00:44:35,940
Please. Save him.

371
00:44:35,940 --> 00:44:38,560
Please save him.

372
00:44:39,850 --> 00:44:44,900
My Yun is the only blood descendant I have.

373
00:44:46,710 --> 00:44:50,160
He is my life.

374
00:44:50,160 --> 00:44:56,630
I'll give you everything I have. Anything.

375
00:44:56,630 --> 00:45:05,530
Please. Just... Just save him. Please, doctor.

376
00:45:08,900 --> 00:45:15,990
We'll do our best.
His best option is a transplant.

377
00:45:15,990 --> 00:45:18,620
But it won't be easy.

378
00:45:18,620 --> 00:45:23,710
Transplant? Do you mean a heart transplant?

379
00:45:23,710 --> 00:45:26,860
Take my heart!

380
00:45:26,860 --> 00:45:32,100
Please. Save him. Take my heart to save him.

381
00:45:32,100 --> 00:45:38,200
I'll do anything. To save him, I can do anything.

382
00:45:38,200 --> 00:45:42,350
I've lived long enough. It's fine.

383
00:45:42,350 --> 00:45:45,390
I can't live without my Yun. I can't.

384
00:45:45,390 --> 00:45:49,540
I'll die as well if my Yun dies, doctor.

385
00:45:49,540 --> 00:45:51,190
Mrs. Oh!

386
00:45:51,190 --> 00:45:52,260
Ma'am!

387
00:45:58,470 --> 00:46:01,250
Ma'am!

388
00:46:06,400 --> 00:46:11,770
I can do anything if it's to save my Yun.

389
00:46:11,770 --> 00:46:17,900
I'll even give you my heart.
Please, save him with my heart, doctor.

390
00:46:35,390 --> 00:46:37,130
Your hand saved me.

391
00:46:40,080 --> 00:46:42,210
During the accident...

392
00:46:44,290 --> 00:46:54,940
I was thinking, "So this is how I die.
I guess this is the end."

393
00:46:57,640 --> 00:46:59,770
Then suddenly, I heard your voice.

394
00:47:14,130 --> 00:47:16,500
It's okay, Yun. It's going to be okay.

395
00:47:20,020 --> 00:47:21,820
It's nothing.

396
00:47:23,610 --> 00:47:32,410
Don't go anywhere. Don't listen to anything.

397
00:47:34,510 --> 00:47:37,880
Just hold my hand tight.

398
00:47:41,550 --> 00:47:47,530
It's okay, Yun. It's nothing.

399
00:48:37,520 --> 00:48:42,910
My Yun is the only blood descendant I have.

400
00:48:44,320 --> 00:48:46,900
He is my life.

401
00:49:46,610 --> 00:49:47,980
Over here.

402
00:50:02,920 --> 00:50:05,390
So you lived in Australia?

403
00:50:08,280 --> 00:50:09,400
Yes.

404
00:50:10,410 --> 00:50:14,700
What kind of people were the parents that raised you?

405
00:50:14,700 --> 00:50:17,890
I don't remember.

406
00:50:19,570 --> 00:50:21,490
I don't want to remember.

407
00:50:23,570 --> 00:50:25,630
Was it a hard life?

408
00:50:30,560 --> 00:50:37,090
No, because I knew I'd be back here some day

409
00:50:37,090 --> 00:50:43,820
to find my birth mother who was
too poor to raise her child

410
00:50:43,820 --> 00:50:48,550
and wanted to buy her a house and
take her out to fancy restaurants.

411
00:50:48,550 --> 00:50:52,730
Because I had hope, it wasn't hard at all.

412
00:51:09,610 --> 00:51:12,430
So... Did you find your mother?

413
00:51:20,800 --> 00:51:21,890
No.

414
00:52:41,750 --> 00:52:43,610
Did you sleep well?

415
00:52:45,360 --> 00:52:46,400
Yeah.

416
00:53:14,750 --> 00:53:16,490
Seed.

417
00:53:18,680 --> 00:53:21,460
This is a pirate.

418
00:53:21,460 --> 00:53:22,890
A monster.

419
00:53:25,160 --> 00:53:29,320
- What's this?
- A fingernail.

420
00:53:29,320 --> 00:53:31,320
It's a skull.

421
00:53:34,290 --> 00:53:35,660
Next.

422
00:53:37,110 --> 00:53:38,840
Skull again.

423
00:53:39,910 --> 00:53:43,130
Circle. Spacecraft.

424
00:53:46,020 --> 00:53:48,390
Do you know anyone in Korea?

425
00:53:49,900 --> 00:53:52,520
Even if you like me that much...

426
00:53:52,520 --> 00:53:56,660
All the way from Australia? Why did you come here?

427
00:54:00,600 --> 00:54:02,090
You Korean?

428
00:54:04,000 --> 00:54:05,780
You're Korean?

429
00:54:08,110 --> 00:54:12,640
I'm saved! Saved!

430
00:54:13,870 --> 00:54:18,150
Love is just a game to me.

431
00:54:19,450 --> 00:54:24,720
Where'd you go?
If you had come any later...

432
00:54:32,020 --> 00:54:33,260
Hey!

433
00:54:34,690 --> 00:54:36,800
Hey, mophead!

434
00:54:36,800 --> 00:54:40,350
You don't even know anyone here,
and yet you still came for me?

435
00:54:42,130 --> 00:54:47,970
In any case, thank you...
For liking a girl like me.

436
00:54:50,070 --> 00:54:51,430
Dear Lord,

437
00:54:52,370 --> 00:55:00,680
if you really do exist, I promise you this.

438
00:55:00,680 --> 00:55:03,100
About Song Eunchae.

439
00:55:03,100 --> 00:55:05,810
If you'll let me have her for my remaining days...

440
00:55:07,200 --> 00:55:11,700
I could stop everything right now.

441
00:55:19,450 --> 00:55:23,140
And go in peace.

442
00:55:28,190 --> 00:55:33,040
Transplant? Do you mean a heart transplant?

443
00:55:34,030 --> 00:55:40,000
Take my heart! Please. Take my heart to save him.

444
00:56:41,610 --> 00:56:46,720
No way... A ghost story for a weak-hearted person?

445
00:56:46,720 --> 00:56:49,430
It's okay. Just tell me.

446
00:56:49,430 --> 00:56:52,310
They don't scare me anymore.

447
00:56:52,310 --> 00:56:55,030
I can't think of any right now.

448
00:56:56,820 --> 00:56:59,660
Have you heard the one with the elevator ghost?

449
00:57:00,360 --> 00:57:01,860
I don't know.

450
00:57:03,380 --> 00:57:08,600
A kid was on his way home after class...

451
00:57:10,500 --> 00:57:13,210
What's wrong, Yun?

452
00:57:13,210 --> 00:57:16,150
Are you okay?

453
00:57:16,150 --> 00:57:18,680
Sorry, let's go inside.

454
00:57:24,020 --> 00:57:26,130
Okay. Breathe in...

455
00:57:27,090 --> 00:57:29,970
Good. Now...

456
00:57:30,740 --> 00:57:32,160
Mr. Choi Yun?

457
00:58:06,460 --> 00:58:07,900
Blockhead!

458
00:58:16,080 --> 00:58:18,210
Hang out with me, Blockhead!

459
00:58:22,000 --> 00:58:25,730
Hang out with me for one minute.

460
00:58:37,230 --> 00:58:39,680
I have to go to Yun.

461
00:58:41,130 --> 00:58:42,610
Mister.

462
00:58:47,940 --> 00:58:50,000
I'll save him.

463
00:58:51,650 --> 00:58:56,570
I'll save Yun.

464
00:58:56,570 --> 00:58:58,080
Mister.

465
00:58:58,080 --> 00:59:00,510
So don't cry.

466
00:59:00,510 --> 00:59:05,950
I can't stand watching you cry.

467
00:59:05,950 --> 00:59:09,270
You look as ugly as Shrek when you cry.

468
00:59:14,560 --> 00:59:19,670
I'll give my heart to Yun, okay?

469
00:59:19,670 --> 00:59:21,200
Mister.

470
00:59:22,300 --> 00:59:26,900
I'll give my heart to Yun,

471
00:59:26,900 --> 00:59:31,240
so will you be with me?

472
00:59:36,560 --> 00:59:42,290
Will you just stay with me while I'm still alive?

473
00:59:58,547 --> 01:00:01,421
[Episode 11 Preview]

474
01:00:01,421 --> 01:00:07,429
Did you think about it? What's there to think about?

475
01:00:07,429 --> 01:00:11,630
It's good for you, me, Yun, and Yun's mom.

476
01:00:11,630 --> 01:00:14,203
Bastard...

477
01:00:14,860 --> 01:00:17,660
You know how to cuss, Blockhead?

478
01:00:17,660 --> 01:00:20,972
Fine, take it out! Give your heart to him!

479
01:00:20,972 --> 01:00:23,468
Take it out!

480
01:00:23,468 --> 01:00:25,892
How can you stoop that low?

481
01:00:25,892 --> 01:00:29,013
Death is not a joke.

482
01:00:30,515 --> 01:00:33,796
[Sorry, I want to have you even if it's like this]

483
01:00:34,108 --> 01:00:37,116
[Love, even if it costs me my life]
